# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Generated cut files and reference pages. Everything under out*/ comes from
# `python generate.py`, so it is rebuilt rather than tracked -- and tracking it
# means every kerf tweak shows up as a diff of thousands of path points.
# Want the SVGs in the repo so people can cut without running Python? Delete
# these two lines and commit out/ once.
out/
out_*/

# Renderer and editor leftovers
*.png.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# The figure artwork is Xykit's "RPG Meeples", personal-use only:
# https://www.printables.com/model/212336-rpg-meeples
# It is tracked so the generator runs straight from a clone. If this repo goes
# public and you would rather not redistribute someone else's files, uncomment
# the line below and tell people in the readme to download the set themselves.
# Meeples svg/
